-artifacts has a real GitHub release and a matching [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]distribution on PyPI, published end to end by the repo's own [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Publish workflow, with the SASE_RELEASE_TOKEN and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]trusted-publishing prerequisites proven rather than assumed.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]research_artifacts_first_release.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Prove the prerequisites and rehearse the unexercised release [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]path[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]preflight[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]preflight: settle the two irreversible decisions with the user (PyPI [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pending publisher, first-release version), create the missing `pypi` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]GitHub environment, rehearse the never-run install-smoke job locally via[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`just test-wheel`, and delete the stale pre-rename release-please [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]branch.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Exercise SASE_RELEASE_TOKEN and open the release PR[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]release_pr[dim] · [dim][/dim]after preflight[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]release_pr: push one trigger commit to master so the release job runs [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]under the new token, then confirm release-please opens the repo's first [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]release PR instead of failing with the \"GitHub Actions is not permitted [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]to create or approve pull requests\" error.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Merge the release PR and drive the publish pipeline green[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]publish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after release_pr[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]publish: merge the release PR, then shepherd the resulting Publish run [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]through the release, build, install-smoke, and publish jobs -- the last [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]three of which have never executed -- until the GitHub release and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]PyPI upload both exist.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Verify the published artifact and record the install blocker[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after publish[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify: confirm the tag, GitHub release, and PyPI files match what CI [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]built, prove the wheel's entry points from the real PyPI artifact, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]file the follow-up for the unresolvable `sase>=0.17.0` floor.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-pt","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-pt.2","reasoning_effort":"high","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-pt.2"},"source_run_id":"run-7db79a009f1bbd1260685c84708e053a","started_at":"2026-08-18T15:47:46.173532+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"4827083a80a8ffe51a7c8fd326f81779f68dfa9deedfc9cab1b336064d63eb09","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-pt.1--2/chat.md","size_bytes":26716},"commits":{"digest":"55c7a89bf3b0934cf43188503e17f7fa730fe780c83890157f7fd8f702ddf44b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-pt.1--2/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"655532495a75afc7fc514fda964573bfe2a06c2fede4fe020adf41d808500a0d